jec@cbnews.cb.att.com (john.collier) wrote that he was struggling to
move up, down, and around in Hell.

Spoilers

Here's what I know about Hell.

   1)  There are only up stairs, never down stairs
   2)  Hell runs from the castle level, which varies, down to level 50.
   3)  Only Chaotic Characters can pray while in hell.
   4)  All characters must be fireproof to survive.
   5)  Vlad's tower, a three level thingy, with entrances only at the
       bottom level, is somewhere in hell.
   6)  There are lots of wizards down there.  Only ONE has the real
       Amulet.


     Once I've cleaned out the castle, I level teleport to level 50,
     and work my way slowly, forever, all the way back up.  That's
     why they call it Hell.
